PARITY (web VehicleCard.tsx -> native), every branch reproduced
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  • Gradient accent strip (web `h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan via-purple to-green`) -> LinearGradient clipped
    to the panel's top corners over TSGlassPanel.
  • TeslaCarViz (web SVG) -> native VehicleCardCarViz: model body SF Symbol + charging bolt overlay + battery
    fill bar (conveys model/battery/charging); parseModelKey fold ported verbatim.
  • Title `display_name || vin` as a navigable element (web <Link to=`/vehicles/${id}`>) -> Button -> onViewDetails.
  • Status (web <StatusBadge status={deriveVehicleStatus(state)} />) -> VehicleCardStatusPill, status localized
    via t('vehicle.state.*') with VEHICLE_STATE_LABELS fallback, tone from VEHICLE_STATE_ENTRIES.variant.
  • Descriptor `{model} {trim} · {vin(mono)}` reproduced (vin rendered monospaced).
  • Stats row `{state && (...)}` (web flex-wrap, native VehicleCardFlowLayout): battery ProgressRing (native
    Gauge, batteryColor tint) + percent + formatDistance(rated_range); formatTemperature(inside_temp) Interior;
    fmtInt(convertDistanceFromSI(odometer)) + unit; charging power cell (charging only); locked + sentry markers.
  • Actions: View details (web ExternalLink) + Remove vehicle (web Trash2 ghost Button) -> onDelete(vehicle).
  • States: loading (skeleton) / empty / error (+retry) / content; plus stale & offline via VehicleCardConnection
    (cached card stays visible with a freshness chip; stale -> one-shot auto-refresh). When the vehicle resolves
    but no live state has arrived, the stats area shows an explicit "Awaiting live telemetry" line — the section
    is never hidden behind a null check.
  • i18n: 24 keys; web keys verbatim (card.interior, card.charging, card.viewDetails, card.removeVehicle) +
    vehicle.state.* status labels + native chrome (freshness/loading/empty/error/stat-label keys).
  • A11y: VoiceOver labels on every interactive element + composed card summary, Dynamic Type (Font.TS roles),
    Reduce-Motion respected (no motion stored; Gauge/strip are static).
  • Telemetry: emits P1/S11 view.opened with surface slug "VehicleCard" on appear (via the model).
  • Data binding (P1/S8): the view performs no I/O; VehicleCardModel binds a VehicleCardSource that production
    wires over useVehicles + useVehicleState(id); useUnits is injected as the VehicleCardUnitsFormatting seam.

